{"title":"Academic Olympiads","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The following is a guide to <b>Academic Olympiads</b>, which are typically the most rigorous of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_competitions\" title=\"Academic competitions\">academic competitions</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Astronomy_Olympiads&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Astronomy Olympiads (page does not exist)\">Astronomy Olympiads</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_Olympiads&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Biology Olympiads (page does not exist)\">Biology Olympiads</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_Olympiads&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Chemistry Olympiads (page does not exist)\">Chemistry Olympiads</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Informatics_Olympiads&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Informatics Olympiads (page does not exist)\">Informatics Olympiads</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Linguistic_Olympiads&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Linguistic Olympiads (page does not exist)\">Linguistic Olympiads</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_Olympiads\" title=\"Mathematics Olympiads\">Mathematics Olympiads</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_Olympiads&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Physics Olympiads (page does not exist)\">Physics Olympiads</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_Olympiads&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018072302\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1577:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018072302 and revision id 2115. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}